      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹4.47 loss per share (further deteriorated from ₹3.75 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.84b (up 9.5% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹1.15b (loss widened 19% from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
